simulatorOptions options temp=60 reltol=1e-5 vabstol=1e-7 iabstol=1e-13
VDD (vdd 0) vsource dc=1.2
VCLK (clk 0) vsource type=pulse val0=0 val1=1.2 period=3.156565656565656e-10 width=1.378282828282828e-10 rise=20p fall=20p
VRST (reset 0) vsource type=pwl wave=[0 1.2 8n 1.2 8.01n 0]
VS0 (s0 0) vsource dc=0
VS1 (s1 0) vsource dc=0
VS2 (s2 0) vsource dc=0
VS3 (s3 0) vsource dc=0
VS4 (s4 0) vsource dc=1.2
VS5 (s5 0) vsource dc=0
XD (clk reset s0 s1 s2 s3 s4 s5 q1 data vdd 0) cmos_even_bank_r4_v14
CL (data 0) capacitor c=10f
tran tran stop=100n outputstart=60n maxstep=1p method=traponly errpreset=conservative
save clk q1 data reset VDD:p XD.ckbank XD.ck4 XD.r4_0 XD.r4_1 XD.r4_2 XD.r4_3 XD.r4_4 XD.r4_5
saveOptions options save=selected

